        "original_id": "5612f0ab-109a-52d4-96ab-3f795542dd2c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Johnny Cage, Jean-Claude Van Damme\n- Products: Mortal Kombat\n- Concepts: fictional characters, parody, martial arts films\n\nFacts:\n- Jean-Claude Van Damme, born Jean-Claude Camille François Van Varenberg on 18 October 1960, is a Belgian actor, martial artist, screenwriter, film producer, and director known for martial arts action films.\n- Johnny Cage is a fictional character in the Mortal Kombat fighting game franchise.\n- Johnny Cage was created as a parody of Jean-Claude Van Damme.\n- Johnny Cage is portrayed as a cocky, overconfident martial arts film actor who provides comic relief in the Mortal Kombat franchise.",
